5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,The morning rush is becoming a physical hazard. We need to address the congestion.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"Before we discuss solutions, we must understand the financial implications for the building.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,I have noticed the same flats seem to claim the best spots repeatedly.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,We must avoid creating a system that breeds resentment among neighbors.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Mio,,Who will actually maintain whatever system we choose? I worry about the workload.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, cost is important, but safety is immediate. We need data on usage.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, without a budget, any proposal is just a wish. I will look into the accounts.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I will check the historical records to see if the current allocation is fair.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at how other buildings handle this to avoid social friction.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Mio,,I will check the physical effort required for maintenance and the current rider numbers.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will observe the morning departures to quantify the bottleneck.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also review the ledger to see if we have funds for changes.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,George,,I will look at the minutes to see if this issue was ever formally addressed.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will check the complaint log to see the nature of past disputes.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will look at the sticker register to see who actually rides daily.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Let us gather facts before arguing opinions.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,Precisely. Reason over emotion.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,George,,I will do my best to be objective.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Let us hope the data is clear.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Mio,,I am ready to help with whatever comes next.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
