60,3,1,talk,Asuka,,Option A is Paid Allocation. Option B is Shared Racks. Option C is Annual Lottery.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,Option A aligns with the ledger findings. It generates income for the building.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"Option C might be fairer, but the minutes suggest it could be contentious.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B seems chaotic given the complaint log. Option A has structure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Mio,,"Option A allows us to hire help for maintenance, solving the workload issue.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Ryuji, does the income from Option A cover the greasing and potential repairs?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, yes, if we set the fee correctly. The ward park fee is a good benchmark.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"@Mio, will the residents accept a monthly charge? The neighbouring block had issues.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@George, the sticker register shows daily riders prefer paying. It might be acceptable.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Shunichi, I think so. It is better than the current chaos.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am leaning towards Option A. It addresses the rain and cost issues.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I vote for Option A. It is the most financially sound.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,I am still undecided. Let us hear the final arguments.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,Option A provides clear accountability. I will support it.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Mio,,Option A is the only one that ensures long-term maintenance. I support it.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Asuka,,I will vote for Option A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will vote for Option A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,3,4,talk,George,,"I will vote for Option A, hoping the management is smooth.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,3,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will vote for Option A.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
